{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：创建或更新AWS Lambda函数。对应需求：执行。官方：AWS Lambda Function Created or Updated。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-60m","index":["filebeat-*","logs-aws.cloudtrail-*"],"interval":"10m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：创建或更新AWS Lambda函数","references":["https://mattslifebytes.com/2023/04/14/from-rebuilds-to-reloads-hacking-aws-lambda-to-enable-instant-code-updates/","https://stratus-red-team.cloud/attack-techniques/AWS/aws.persistence.lambda-overwrite-code/","https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/api/API_UpdateFunctionCode.html"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"1251b98a-ff45-11ee-89a1-f661ea17fbce","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.dataset: \"aws.cloudtrail\"\n    and event.provider: \"lambda.amazonaws.com\"\n    and event.outcome: \"success\"\n    and event.action: (CreateFunction* or UpdateFunctionCode*)\n    and not user_agent.original: (*Terraform* or *Pulumi*)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1648","name":"Serverless Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1648/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"aws","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：创建或更新AWS Lambda函数\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":6,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{